	(text "[ ] U9 pin map: TWI0 PA2/PA3, USART0 PA0/PA1 (CP2102N), USART1 PC0/PC1 (J10),\n     ADC on PD0-PD2 (A2-A4); firmware pin table must follow it.\n[ ] Y1: CL 12.5 pF, C41/C42 15p assumes 5 pF pin + ~2 pF stray (XOSC32K LPMODE=0);\n     trim after measuring the 32 kHz error.\n[ ] TX_LED (old Empyrean D13 LED) has no pin; only SYNC on PF5. Free J4 D4/D10 if needed.\n[ ] D10/R35 UPDI diode kept from Si5351AVFO J5; confirm.\n[ ] Q6-Q9 changed 2N7002 -> AO3400A (2N7002 Vth up to 2.5 V, no Rds(on) spec below 4.5 V).\n[ ] +5V now from USB-C VBUS only (500 mA default USB); PA draw not yet measured."
